The market research firm said sales of OLED panels are expected to reach $20.7 billion next year, with the share of the smartphone market expected to reach 50.7 percent. On the other hand, sales of TFT-LCD panels are expected to reach $20.2 billion, with the share expected to reach 49.3 percent.
The OLED panel market is expected to continue to grow, with the share is expected to reach 73 percent in 2025.
The rapid growth of the OLED panel market is attributed to its excellent image quality in addition to its thin and light characteristics. Also, flexible OLED panels with an unbreakable substrate are easy to produce for full-screen displays.
